			description: [
				"&eThe coiling machine bends wire or rods into repeated turns. A controlled coil gives a spring its working shape: movement can be taken up along the coil instead of being concentrated in a short straight piece.&r"
				""
				"&eIts springs are used in machining and biological equipment, where parts must return after a stroke or accommodate repeated movement.&r"
			]
			disable_toast: true
