		{
			dependencies: ["612A2B07C4F613E6"]
			description: [
				"&eA cutting blade concentrates force along a narrow edge, removing material from the workpiece. The edge and the body behind it must withstand repeated contact without losing their shape.&r"
				""
				"&eIndustrial iron blades supply the cutting parts of lathes and spring coiling machines.&r"
